    "agent_query": "Read AGENT_TASK.md and README_AGENT.md first. Implement a query-agnostic, ratio-agnostic KVScorer for frozen Qwen3-8B. One score tensor must support global top-10%, top-20%, and top-30% retention across retrieval, contextual-QA and redundancy workloads, with contexts up to 32,000 tokens. Version every candidate, preserve every fail-closed check, and leave FINAL_VERSION on the strongest clean candidate. Scorers must not use token identity in any form, and each score call must do its own work (see AGENT_TASK.md). Public tests are for getting the scorer working: use the one, quick, and full public commands. Your score comes from hidden test cases: every sforge-submit --details evaluates them and waits for the result, and your final result is the best valid score you reach within the time budget."
  },
