        "Phase A (unprivileged worker, context only) emits one finite score tensor per row; Phase B (trusted) decodes full-cache and compressed answers without candidate code",
        "a fresh scorer per row; each layer is scored twice, the repeat on fresh input copies, and the smaller time counts",
        "task relative accuracy = compressed / full-cache task accuracy; groups mean over tasks; ratio mean over groups; primary = 100 x mean over ratios",
